If the directory is called "nethackdir", it's probably only the directory
where game related data is kept. You should then have an executable file
(probably called "nethack" or "hack") in the ordinary game directory.
If you can't find that file, or the directory is called something else,
the executable file is probably in the directory you mentioned.
Since you cannot change directory to that one, there are probably some
permissions on gaming or something like that on your school. Mail your sys-
admin and ask him about it. (Or, if the directory is set up by some ordinary
user, check with 'ls -l', you should mail him/her instead)

